#: ../inc/settings.php:40
msgid "Squeeze Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres Squeeze"

#: ../inc/settings.php:41, ../inc/settings.php:1495, ../inc/settings.php:1524, ../inc/premium/premium.php:555
msgid "Squeeze"
msgstr "Squeeze"

#: ../inc/settings.php:51, ../inc/settings.php:52
msgid "Squeeze Bulk Tools"
msgstr "Outils Squeeze Bulk"

#: ../inc/settings.php:101
msgid ""
"Compress and convert images in bulk. \"Squeeze\" means optimize file size "
"(and optionally change format) for items in your Media Library or a folder "
"you choose."
msgstr ""
"Compressez et convertissez des images en masse. « Squeeze » signifie "
"optimiser la taille des fichiers (et éventuellement changer le format) pour "
"les éléments de votre bibliothèque de médias ou un dossier de votre choix."

#: ../inc/settings.php:110
msgid "Bulk Media Library Squeeze"
msgstr "Compression en masse de la bibliothèque de médias"

#: ../inc/settings.php:111
msgid ""
"Uses attachments in the library; backups follow your plugin settings. With "
"Direct WebP and Backup original on, backups are saved as .bak.webp."
msgstr ""
"Utilise les pièces jointes de la bibliothèque ; les sauvegardes suivent vos "
"paramètres du plugin. Avec Direct WebP et Backup original activés, les "
"sauvegardes sont enregistrées en .bak.webp."

#: ../inc/settings.php:122
msgid "Direct WebP conversion is on <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">(change)</a>"
msgstr ""
"La conversion Direct WebP est activée <a href=\"%s\" "
"target=\"_blank\">(modifier)</a>"

#: ../inc/settings.php:126
msgid ""
"After conversion, image URLs may change. Check themes and content for "
"hard-coded .jpg / .png links (image blocks, custom HTML, CSS, or "
"shortcodes) so nothing breaks."
msgstr ""
"Après conversion, les URL des images peuvent changer. Vérifiez thèmes et "
"contenus pour les liens .jpg / .png codés en dur (blocs d'image, HTML "
"personnalisé, CSS ou shortcodes) afin que rien ne casse."

#: ../inc/settings.php:127
msgid ""
"If Backup original is enabled, the .bak copy is converted to WebP as well "
"(e.g. photo.bak.webp)."
msgstr ""
"Si Backup original est activé, la copie .bak est également convertie en "
"WebP (p. ex. photo.bak.webp)."

#: ../inc/settings.php:136, ../inc/settings.php:413
msgid "complete"
msgstr "terminé"

#: ../inc/settings.php:139, ../inc/settings.php:416
msgid "Squeezed images"
msgstr "Images compressées"

#: ../inc/settings.php:151
#. translators: %s: plugin version that started tracking savings
msgid "Total saved (since version %s)"
msgstr "Total économisé (depuis la version %s)"

#: ../inc/settings.php:160
#: assets/js/helpers.js:611
#. translators: 1: human-readable bytes saved, 2: number of images with savings data
msgid "%1$s on %2$d images"
msgstr "%1$s sur %2$d images"

#: ../inc/settings.php:177, ../inc/settings.php:436
msgid "Processed (success)"
msgstr "Traitées (succès)"

#: ../inc/settings.php:181, ../inc/settings.php:440
msgid "Remaining or needs attention"
msgstr "Restantes ou nécessitent une attention"

#: ../inc/settings.php:191, ../inc/settings.php:450
msgid "Bulk squeezing paused"
msgstr "Compression en masse en pause"

#: ../inc/settings.php:197, ../inc/settings.php:203
msgid ""
"Compress only images that have not been squeezed yet. Click again while "
"running to pause."
msgstr ""
"Compressez uniquement les images pas encore compressées. Cliquez à nouveau "
"pendant l'exécution pour mettre en pause."

#: ../inc/settings.php:201
#: assets/js/helpers.js:6
msgid "Squeeze new images"
msgstr "Compresser les nouvelles images"

#: ../inc/settings.php:206, ../inc/settings.php:212
msgid ""
"Run compression again on every library image, including ones already "
"squeezed. Use after changing quality or WebP settings."
msgstr ""
"Relancez la compression sur toutes les images de la bibliothèque, y compris "
"celles déjà compressées. À utiliser après un changement de qualité ou de "
"paramètres WebP."

#: ../inc/settings.php:210
#: assets/js/helpers.js:7
msgid "Re-squeeze all images"
msgstr "Recompresser toutes les images"

#: ../inc/settings.php:219
msgid "Directory Squeeze"
msgstr "Compression par répertoire"

#: ../inc/settings.php:220
msgid ""
"Filesystem folder — not limited to Media Library. When Backup original is "
"on, .bak files are written beside images; with Direct WebP on, those "
"backups are WebP too (e.g. photo.bak.webp). Restore backups with the button "
"below (in-place; .bak is removed after success). Media Library year/month "
"folders are blocked; use Bulk Media Library Squeeze for those."
msgstr ""
"Dossier du système de fichiers — non limité à la bibliothèque de médias. "
"Avec Backup original activé, les fichiers .bak sont écrits à côté des "
"images ; avec Direct WebP, ces sauvegardes sont aussi en WebP (p. ex. "
"photo.bak.webp). Restaurez les sauvegardes avec le bouton ci-dessous (sur "
"place ; .bak supprimé après succès). Les dossiers année/mois de la "
"bibliothèque de médias sont bloqués ; utilisez la compression en masse de "
"la bibliothèque de médias."

#: ../inc/settings.php:226
msgid "Directory path"
msgstr "Chemin du répertoire"

#: ../inc/settings.php:227
msgid "Relative to site root."
msgstr "Relatif à la racine du site."

#: ../inc/settings.php:236
#: assets/js/helpers.js:471
msgid "Clear the path field"
msgstr "Vider le champ de chemin"

#: ../inc/settings.php:237
#: assets/js/helpers.js:470
msgid "Clear path"
msgstr "Vider le chemin"

#: ../inc/settings.php:243
msgid "Clear path only empties the field — it does not delete files on disk."
msgstr ""
"Vider le chemin ne fait que vider le champ — aucun fichier sur le disque "
"n'est supprimé."

#: ../inc/settings.php:251, ../inc/settings.php:276
msgid "Select Directory"
msgstr "Sélectionner un répertoire"

#: ../inc/settings.php:256
msgid "Select Directory for Squeeze"
msgstr "Sélectionner un répertoire pour Squeeze"

#: ../inc/settings.php:268
msgid "Loading directories..."
msgstr "Chargement des répertoires..."

#: ../inc/settings.php:286
#: assets/js/helpers.js:8
msgid "Run Directory Squeeze"
msgstr "Lancer la compression par répertoire"

#: ../inc/settings.php:292
msgid "Restore backups in selected folders"
msgstr "Restaurer les sauvegardes dans les dossiers sélectionnés"

#: ../inc/settings.php:300
msgid "Premium"
msgstr "Premium"

#: ../inc/settings.php:301, ../inc/settings.php:337, ../inc/settings.php:399
msgid "Squeeze from a page"
msgstr "Compresser depuis une page"

#: ../inc/settings.php:302, ../inc/settings.php:720
msgid ""
"Paste the URL of a slow page and squeeze every image on it — the page "
"PageSpeed complains about."
msgstr ""
"Collez l'URL d'une page lente et compressez toutes ses images — la page que "
"PageSpeed signale."

#: ../inc/settings.php:306
msgid "Page URL"
msgstr "URL de la page"

#: ../inc/settings.php:317
msgid ""
"Available in Premium. The URL field is shown so you can see how the "
"workflow works."
msgstr ""
"Disponible en Premium. Le champ URL est affiché pour que vous puissiez voir "
"le fonctionnement."

#: ../inc/settings.php:322
msgid "Unlock with Premium"
msgstr "Débloquer avec Premium"

#: ../inc/settings.php:338
msgid ""
"Choose a page and squeeze every image on it — the page PageSpeed complains "
"about."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez une page et compressez toutes ses images — la page que PageSpeed "
"signale."

#: ../inc/settings.php:342
msgid "Page"
msgstr "Page"

#: ../inc/settings.php:358
msgid "Search pages…"
msgstr "Rechercher des pages…"

#: ../inc/settings.php:376
msgid "Search by title, then squeeze every image found on that page."
msgstr "Recherchez par titre, puis compressez chaque image trouvée sur cette page."

#: ../inc/settings.php:384
msgid "Squeeze from this page"
msgstr "Compresser depuis cette page"

#: ../inc/settings.php:404
msgid "Fetching images from the selected page and squeezing them in your browser."
msgstr ""
"Récupération des images de la page sélectionnée et compression dans votre "
"navigateur."

#: ../inc/settings.php:424
msgid "Fetching images..."
msgstr "Récupération des images..."

#: ../inc/settings.php:456
msgid "Pause or resume squeezing images from this page."
msgstr "Mettre en pause ou reprendre la compression des images de cette page."

#: ../inc/settings.php:460
msgid "Pause Squeezing"
msgstr "Mettre en pause la compression"

#: ../inc/settings.php:462
msgid ""
"Click again while running to pause. Keep this tab open until the run "
"finishes."
msgstr ""
"Cliquez à nouveau pendant l'exécution pour mettre en pause. Gardez cet "
"onglet ouvert jusqu'à la fin."

#: ../inc/settings.php:476
msgid "Processed formats:"
msgstr "Formats traités :"

#: ../inc/settings.php:477
msgid ""
"You can change the image formats for squeezing on the <a href=\"%s\" "
"target=\"_blank\">settings page.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez modifier les formats d'image à compresser sur la <a href=\"%s\" "
"target=\"_blank\">page des paramètres.</a>"

#: ../inc/settings.php:487
msgid "Start Squeezing your images and watch the progress here."
msgstr "Commencez à compresser vos images et suivez la progression ici."

#: ../inc/settings.php:516
msgid ""
"The Apache mod_rewrite module is not enabled on your server OR your server "
"is not running Apache."
msgstr ""
"Le module Apache mod_rewrite n'est pas activé sur votre serveur OU votre "
"serveur n'utilise pas Apache."

#: ../inc/settings.php:517
msgid ""
"To serve WebP, enable mod_rewrite, or switch to \"Rewrite <img> src to WebP "
"URLs in HTML\" delivery."
msgstr ""
"Pour servir du WebP, activez mod_rewrite ou passez à la livraison « Rewrite "
"<img> src to WebP URLs in HTML »."

