#: ../inc/settings.php:1001, ../inc/settings.php:1098
msgid "Direct WebP"
msgstr "Direct WebP"

#: ../inc/settings.php:1002
msgid "Replace originals with .webp on disk. Lowest storage; URLs change to .webp."
msgstr ""
"Remplace les originaux par .webp sur le disque. Stockage minimal ; les URL "
"passent en .webp."

#: ../inc/settings.php:1005
msgid "Advanced delivery methods"
msgstr "Méthodes de livraison avancées"

#: ../inc/settings.php:1007
msgid ""
"Keep JPEG/PNG originals and serve WebP via a separate folder. Prefer Direct "
"WebP unless you have a specific hosting constraint."
msgstr ""
"Conservez les originaux JPEG/PNG et servez le WebP via un dossier séparé. "
"Préférez Direct WebP sauf contrainte d'hébergement spécifique."

#: ../inc/settings.php:1011
msgid "PHP / any host"
msgstr "PHP / tout hébergeur"

#: ../inc/settings.php:1012, ../inc/settings.php:1102
msgid "Rewrite <img> src to WebP URLs in HTML"
msgstr "Rewrite <img> src to WebP URLs in HTML"

#: ../inc/settings.php:1013
msgid ""
"Keeps JPEG/PNG in uploads and WebP copies under squeeze-webp. Squeeze "
"changes src and srcset in the page HTML to the WebP path. Best when "
".htaccess rewrites are missing (Nginx, CDN, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Conserve JPEG/PNG dans uploads et copies WebP sous squeeze-webp. Squeeze "
"modifie src et srcset dans le HTML de la page vers le chemin WebP. Idéal "
"quand les réécritures .htaccess manquent (Nginx, CDN, etc.)."

#: ../inc/settings.php:1017
msgid "Apache / .htaccess"
msgstr "Apache / .htaccess"

#: ../inc/settings.php:1018, ../inc/settings.php:1100
msgid "Keep JPEG/PNG URLs — server serves WebP"
msgstr "Keep JPEG/PNG URLs — server serves WebP"

#: ../inc/settings.php:1019
msgid ""
"Keeps originals in uploads; WebP files go to squeeze-webp. Page HTML still "
"shows .jpg/.png URLs. The server rewrite rules send WebP bytes when the "
"browser supports it — no HTML changes."
msgstr ""
"Conserve les originaux dans uploads ; les WebP vont dans squeeze-webp. Le "
"HTML affiche toujours des URL .jpg/.png. Les règles de réécriture du "
"serveur envoient du WebP si le navigateur le supporte — sans modification "
"du HTML."

#: ../inc/settings.php:1026, ../inc/settings.php:1037
msgid "Not compatible with WP Offload Media"
msgstr "Non compatible avec WP Offload Media"

#: ../inc/settings.php:1027
msgid ""
"The \"Keep JPEG/PNG URLs — server serves WebP\" mode relies on Apache "
".htaccess rewrite rules that only work for requests reaching your origin "
"server. When WP Offload Media is active, image URLs point to an external "
"CDN (S3, GCS, DigitalOcean Spaces, etc.) and those requests never pass "
"through your .htaccess — so WebP files will not be served."
msgstr ""
"Le mode « Keep JPEG/PNG URLs — server serves WebP » repose sur des règles "
"de réécriture Apache .htaccess qui ne fonctionnent que pour les requêtes "
"atteignant votre serveur d'origine. Avec WP Offload Media actif, les URL "
"d'images pointent vers un CDN externe (S3, GCS, DigitalOcean Spaces, etc.) "
"et ces requêtes ne passent jamais par votre .htaccess — les WebP ne seront "
"donc pas servis."

#: ../inc/settings.php:1029, ../inc/settings.php:1040
msgid ""
"Please switch to <strong>Direct WebP</strong> conversion — it converts "
"images to WebP in-place and WP Offload Media handles uploading "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Passez à la conversion <strong>Direct WebP</strong> — elle convertit les "
"images sur place et WP Offload Media gère le téléversement automatiquement."

#: ../inc/settings.php:1038
msgid ""
"The \"Rewrite <img> src to WebP URLs in HTML\" mode is not compatible with "
"WP Offload Media. WebP sidecar files are stored in a local squeeze-webp/ "
"folder and are never pushed to your external storage provider (S3, GCS, "
"DigitalOcean Spaces, etc.), so they cannot be served from your CDN URL."
msgstr ""
"Le mode « Rewrite <img> src to WebP URLs in HTML » n'est pas compatible "
"avec WP Offload Media. Les fichiers WebP sidecar sont stockés dans un "
"dossier local squeeze-webp/ et ne sont jamais envoyés à votre fournisseur "
"de stockage externe (S3, GCS, DigitalOcean Spaces, etc.), ils ne peuvent "
"donc pas être servis depuis votre URL CDN."

#: ../inc/settings.php:1047
msgid "Show example: Rewrite <img> src to WebP URLs in HTML"
msgstr "Afficher l'exemple : Rewrite <img> src to WebP URLs in HTML"

#: ../inc/settings.php:1049
