msgid "Squeeze – Image Optimization & Compression, WebP Conversion"
msgstr "Squeeze – Optimisation et compression d'images, conversion WebP"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Compress unlimited images directly into your browser. Convert images to "
"WebP format. No limits on file size or number of images. No third-party "
"services or API keys required."
msgstr ""
"Compressez un nombre illimité d'images directement dans votre navigateur. "
"Convertissez en WebP. Aucune limite de taille ou de nombre. Aucun service "
"tiers ni clé API requis."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Bogdan Bendziukov"
msgstr "Bogdan Bendziukov"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://pluginarium.com"
msgstr "https://pluginarium.com"

#: assets/js/admin.js:203
msgid ""
"Switching WebP delivery mode does not migrate existing files. Re-squeeze "
"images after saving. Leftover JPEG/PNG + WebP pairs or orphaned files under "
"squeeze-webp may remain until cleaned up."
msgstr ""
"Changer le mode de livraison WebP ne migre pas les fichiers existants. "
"Recompressez les images après l'enregistrement. Des paires JPEG/PNG + WebP "
"ou fichiers orphelins sous squeeze-webp peuvent rester jusqu'au nettoyage."

